# Yae Emilie Fischl Xiangling. ~25s Rot. Yae Quickburn. Yae uses burst every rotation after 3N1CD to regen stamina. Constant Electro application from Yae & Fischl skills leads to high Overload count, as Xiangling uses skill twice per rotation.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
yae char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
yae add weapon="widsith" refine=3 lvl=90/90;
#yae add weapon="solarpearl" refine=1 lvl=90/90;
yae add set="ur" count=4;
#yae add set="gd" count=4;
#yae add set="gt" count=4;
yae add stats hp=4780 atk=311 em=187 electro%=0.466 cr=0.311; #main
yae add stats def%=0.124 def=39.36 hp=507.88 hp%=0.0992 atk=33.08 atk%=0.0992 er=0.1102 em=198.2 cr=0.2648 cd=0.5296; # CR
